` THE KIND OF GAME. "New Game" on the menu asks how long the game should be, and which mode it is in.
` the length is how many rounds there are. when the last one has been won, the game is over.
` the mode is normal or zen. a zen game starts with the "seamless" passive, and that is all that it
` ever gets: there is no upgrade screen. when the bar fills up, it empties out and the next round starts.
` the menu changes the two options, and they are remembered for the next time the game is run. they only
` turn into the rules of a game when one is started. apply_game_options, in fish_routines_menu, does that.
